[Notes.Instructions_Hardcore_AbstrInv DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Burglar"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Steal the six Clockwork Eggs and exit the mansion.\n\nSneak into the mansion to recover the Eggs and as many valuables as you can.\nDo NOT get spotted. Nobody should know you were there. \nThere are six Clockwork Eggs to find, as well as heirlooms, paintings, and coins. \n\nYou have no supernatural powers. \nSome doors and chests are now locked.\nThe placement of many valuables has changed.\n\nScoring: \n* Avoiding the guards is worth more points than knocking them unconscious,  which in turn is worth more than killing them.\n* The more optional loot you gather, the more points you will score.\n\nSpecial: \nThis mansion is full of secrets, look everywhere. \nBe on the lookout for the 16 hidden figurines.\n\nGame Over: \nThe challenge is over when you get spotted 3 times or die."

[Notes.instructions_hardcore_pickup DisTweaks_AbstractItemPickupNote]
m_PressKeyToReadMessage=""
m_OnPickupMessage=""

[Notes.Instructions_Normal_AbstrInv DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Burglar"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Steal the six Clockwork Eggs and exit the mansion.\n\nSneak into the mansion to recover the Eggs and as many valuables as you can.\nDo NOT get spotted. Nobody should know you were there. \nThere are six Clockwork Eggs to find, as well as heirlooms, paintings, and coins. \n\nScoring: \n* Avoiding the guards is worth more points than knocking them unconscious,  which in turn is worth more than killing them.\n* The more optional loot you gather, the more points you will score\n\nSpecial: \nThis mansion is full of secrets, look everywhere. \n\nGame Over: \nThe challenge is over when you get spotted 3 times or die."

[Notes.instructions_normal_pickup DisTweaks_AbstractItemPickupNote]
m_PressKeyToReadMessage=""
m_OnPickupMessage=""

[Notes.Rhyme2_AbstrInv DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="A Clue"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Suspicious behavior comes in all forms.\nNo one puts an ashtray upside down, for example.  \nIt's just not normal.\nJust a thought."

[Notes.Rhyme3_AbstrInv DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="A Clue"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="One shouldn't limit themselves to cliche.\nNot all secret passages are activated by books in bookshelves, for example.\nBut some are.\nOne also shouldn't be blind to cliche."

[Notes.Rhyme_AbstrInv DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="A Clue"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Seek the space between middle and top,\nfor the three random elements that make whole,\nyour quest to pilfer all that glitters."

